1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,000
What do you think?

2
00:00:02,120 --> 00:00:04,960
The drum as a spiritual
torture device is a nice touch.

3
00:00:05,879 --> 00:00:07,120
The title has a lot of soul.

4
00:00:07,160 --> 00:00:08,520
The story is quite unconventional.

5
00:00:08,960 --> 00:00:10,480
Waiting for your word, Lang Di.

6
00:00:10,599 --> 00:00:11,599
Alright.

7
00:00:22,120 --> 00:00:23,120
Wait a minute.

8
00:00:23,879 --> 00:00:24,879
There's more?

9
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:27,279
Brother Guo is bringing
Zhiyuan to the company later.

10
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:28,518
I have a dinner meeting tonight.

11
00:00:28,519 --> 00:00:29,719
Can you watch the kid for me?

12
00:00:29,960 --> 00:00:31,240
I'm not exactly great with kids.

13
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,159
You'll learn. I'm off.

14
00:00:57,560 --> 00:00:58,359
Guo.

15
00:00:58,520 --> 00:00:59,679
When are you coming?

16
00:00:59,799 --> 00:01:00,799
Where to?

17
00:01:03,200 --> 00:01:05,560
Sister Jialin said you're
bringing Zhiyuan to the company.

18
00:01:05,879 --> 00:01:07,680
Isn't Han Lu watching the kid today?

19
00:01:08,719 --> 00:01:09,719
Huh?

20
00:01:13,800 --> 00:01:21,800
"A Winter Sun Wakes the Wind in Spring Hills' Dream"

21
00:01:25,500 --> 00:01:29,300
(Episode 15: Vortex Core)

22
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,960
If I don't say anything,

23
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,840
are you just going to stand
there like a statue all night?

24
00:02:22,800 --> 00:02:23,919
If I don't come over,

25
00:02:24,120 --> 00:02:25,840
are you just going to wait there all night?

26
00:02:27,319 --> 00:02:28,319
The woods are too big,

27
00:02:28,599 --> 00:02:29,919
and you run too fast.

28
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,759
I only dare to wait right here.

29
00:02:38,280 --> 00:02:39,280
Come here.

30
00:03:11,919 --> 00:03:13,199
There are security cameras here.

31
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:15,319
I'll delete the footage later.

32
00:03:17,719 --> 00:03:18,960
The boss has the footage.

33
00:03:47,560 --> 00:03:48,560
Phone.

34
00:03:51,192 --> 00:03:52,966
[He's adding a new
number to his contact]

35
00:03:53,000 --> 00:03:54,336
I didn't tell my family I was back.

36
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,560
I'm using a new number.

37
00:03:57,719 --> 00:03:59,199
This stray dog has nowhere to go.

38
00:04:01,400 --> 00:04:02,719
Even if I did, I wouldn't go.

39
00:04:02,840 --> 00:04:03,919
I'm going home with you.

40
00:04:12,800 --> 00:04:13,800
You bought so much stuff.

41
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:14,880
Not planning on going out?

42
00:04:15,639 --> 00:04:17,040
I put all my work on hold for you.

43
00:04:17,800 --> 00:04:19,199
Did you pass your assessment?

44
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:21,800
Hold on a second.

45
00:04:22,439 --> 00:04:23,439
What if I did?
What if I didn't?

46
00:04:24,800 --> 00:04:26,360
If I passed, I go to the Hunter School.

47
00:04:26,680 --> 00:04:28,640
I report back in mid-July
and leave in late July.

48
00:04:33,399 --> 00:04:34,399
Got it.

49
00:04:36,839 --> 00:04:38,399
Aren't you going to ask if I passed?

50
00:04:40,240 --> 00:04:41,680
Is it even possible for you to fail?

51
00:04:49,639 --> 00:04:51,040
I can only stay for 21 days.

52
00:04:51,439 --> 00:04:54,079
Let's figure out how to make
these 21 days feel like 21 years.

53
00:04:55,600 --> 00:04:57,399
Why not 210 years?

54
00:04:58,199 --> 00:05:00,199
In the grand scheme of the universe,

55
00:05:00,399 --> 00:05:03,439
there's no difference
between 21 days and 210 years.

56
00:05:09,439 --> 00:05:11,319
How long will you be at the Hunter School?

57
00:05:13,079 --> 00:05:14,800
Normally, about a year.

58
00:05:15,800 --> 00:05:17,040
And if it's not normal?

59
00:05:20,319 --> 00:05:22,639
I don't know what kind of
abnormal situations might arise.

60
00:05:23,040 --> 00:05:24,439
But no matter what happens,

61
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:27,000
there are only two paths for a person.

62
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,680
Let's go back to Molie before you leave.

63
00:05:57,279 --> 00:05:58,319
It's too far.

64
00:06:29,199 --> 00:06:30,199
The door is unlocked.

65
00:06:35,120 --> 00:06:36,399
Uncle, Auntie.

66
00:06:37,279 --> 00:06:38,279
Shuo.

67
00:06:43,000 --> 00:06:44,000
Come here.

68
00:06:44,519 --> 00:06:46,680
Take a look, is this him?

69
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,439
It's too fast.

70
00:06:48,440 --> 00:06:50,079
It just flashed by.

71
00:06:51,120 --> 00:06:53,040
Alright, I'll take a screenshot for you.

72
00:06:54,199 --> 00:06:55,199
Ah.

73
00:06:55,519 --> 00:06:56,519
Hey.

74
00:06:56,800 --> 00:07:00,240
Look, this is a celebrity party.

75
00:07:00,519 --> 00:07:02,120
This kid has some serious backing.

76
00:07:02,439 --> 00:07:06,480
Wait, when my cousin was
lying in that hospital bed,

77
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:08,838
why didn't you ask him for more money?

78
00:07:08,839 --> 00:07:10,399
You could've asked for a million or so.

79
00:07:11,279 --> 00:07:13,439
He offered, but your uncle refused.

80
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,199
Why? Why turn down free money?

81
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,879
Weren't we afraid he'd
bring bad luck to Zhu?

82
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:22,600
Who'd dare take money from a jinx like him?

83
00:07:23,079 --> 00:07:25,039
That's foolish. You
should take what's yours.

84
00:07:25,040 --> 00:07:26,840
And curse him out
when he deserves it, right?

85
00:07:29,079 --> 00:07:30,439
Hey, look.

86
00:07:31,519 --> 00:07:32,519
Is it really him?

87
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:36,839
Oh, yes.

88
00:07:36,879 --> 00:07:38,079
Yes, that's him.

89
00:07:42,120 --> 00:07:44,439
Alright, I know what to do.

90
00:07:44,639 --> 00:07:46,439
Here's the plan.

91
00:07:46,680 --> 00:07:48,000
We'll register a new account.

92
00:07:48,120 --> 00:07:51,439
Then we'll keep posting this video on it.

93
00:07:51,879 --> 00:07:53,838
After that, we'll start a livestream.

94
00:07:53,839 --> 00:07:54,999
People will definitely watch.

95
00:07:55,040 --> 00:07:56,199
Then, Auntie, do this.

96
00:07:56,240 --> 00:07:58,198
Send me a few more photos

97
00:07:58,199 --> 00:07:59,599
of my cousin and this boy.

98
00:07:59,600 --> 00:08:02,040
I'll print them out and hang
them up in our livestream room.

99
00:08:03,600 --> 00:08:05,439
This will make us money.

100
00:08:08,040 --> 00:08:09,040
Just watch.

101
00:08:25,920 --> 00:08:28,640
Brother Guo called and told me to
livestream at the company tonight.

102
00:08:30,240 --> 00:08:31,520
It's promo for the variety show.

103
00:08:32,120 --> 00:08:33,240
You sure know a lot.

104
00:08:34,480 --> 00:08:35,480
Go ahead.

105
00:08:36,919 --> 00:08:38,600
If I go livestream, what will you do?

106
00:08:39,039 --> 00:08:40,039
Me?

107
00:08:40,320 --> 00:08:41,639
I'll watch your livestream.

108
00:08:42,879 --> 00:08:44,600
I want you in my sight at all times.

109
00:08:51,720 --> 00:08:53,400
Does your company have that kind of glass?

110
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:55,279
The one-way mirror kind?

111
00:08:56,600 --> 00:08:58,039
Our company isn't a prison.

112
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,879
I pushed the livestream to tonight.

113
00:09:10,200 --> 00:09:11,200
I'll do it at home.

114
00:09:11,840 --> 00:09:13,040
It's just a video call anyway.

115
00:09:13,279 --> 00:09:14,879
You can hide behind my phone.

116
00:09:14,919 --> 00:09:16,559
That way, I can watch you while I stream.

117
00:09:17,639 --> 00:09:19,200
That's very unprofessional of you.

118
00:09:19,399 --> 00:09:21,296
Your fans will think you're
smiling at one person,

119
00:09:21,320 --> 00:09:23,280
when the truth is you're
smiling at someone else.

120
00:09:24,039 --> 00:09:26,199
Well, it's better than not
being able to smile at all.

121
00:09:28,200 --> 00:09:32,039
A white lie is always
kinder than a cruel truth.

122
00:09:33,360 --> 00:09:34,720
Auntie, do you have any more?

123
00:09:35,360 --> 00:09:36,480
Keep looking.

124
00:09:36,759 --> 00:09:37,759
Ah, ah.

125
00:09:39,240 --> 00:09:41,319
I have some paperwork
to sort out before I leave.

126
00:09:41,320 --> 00:09:42,920
You can schedule your work for that day.

127
00:09:45,000 --> 00:09:46,280
I'll go with you to get it done.

128
00:09:47,840 --> 00:09:48,840
You?

129
00:09:50,039 --> 00:09:51,600
If you go, it'll take until next year.

130
00:09:51,720 --> 00:09:53,960
Everyone will stop working
just to take photos with you.

131
00:09:54,840 --> 00:09:55,639
Oh.

132
00:09:55,759 --> 00:09:56,720
The traffic is rolling in.
Hey, Auntie.

133
00:09:57,560 --> 00:09:59,216
These celebrities really
do bring in the views.

134
00:09:59,240 --> 00:10:00,840
I haven't been to your place yet.

135
00:10:02,440 --> 00:10:03,599
Mom went to the temple.

136
00:10:03,600 --> 00:10:04,879
I sold that house.

137
00:10:05,600 --> 00:10:07,879
The paparazzi and stalkers
know that address anyway.

138
00:10:08,320 --> 00:10:09,920
It wouldn't be convenient for you to go.

139
00:10:10,519 --> 00:10:12,200
When you get back, we'll go live in Molie.

140
00:10:12,399 --> 00:10:13,639
It's peaceful in the mountains.

141
00:10:14,080 --> 00:10:16,399
I transferred my house
in Molie to my cousin.

142
00:10:19,000 --> 00:10:20,120
I'm not going back.

143
00:10:20,600 --> 00:10:22,679
Don't worry about not having a house.

144
00:10:23,000 --> 00:10:23,799
When I get back,

145
00:10:23,800 --> 00:10:25,240
we'll build our own little cabin.

146
00:10:27,320 --> 00:10:28,320
A cabin sounds good.

147
00:10:35,440 --> 00:10:36,240
Veggies.

148
00:10:36,440 --> 00:10:37,440
Put the knife away.

149
00:10:38,240 --> 00:10:39,240
Hmph.

150
00:10:40,919 --> 00:10:41,919
Then switch to this.

151
00:10:54,720 --> 00:10:56,600
What if I don't even
have the energy to speak?

152
00:10:57,000 --> 00:10:58,600
It's your fault for not wanting to move.

153
00:11:04,720 --> 00:11:06,440
I'm right here, and I'm not deaf.

154
00:11:10,000 --> 00:11:11,000
Brother Guo.

155
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,879
You believe everything he says.

156
00:11:13,200 --> 00:11:14,840
Do I look like a lazy person to you?

157
00:11:15,240 --> 00:11:18,919
You two can save your pillow
talk for after the livestream.

158
00:11:19,279 --> 00:11:20,919
Don't let it slip out by accident.

159
00:11:25,279 --> 00:11:26,919
If it does, I'll send you a red envelope.

160
00:11:30,240 --> 00:11:32,240
19,999.

161
00:11:44,519 --> 00:11:46,240
Hello, just warming up.

162
00:11:47,120 --> 00:11:48,600
What are you busy with?

163
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:50,000
Adjusting the lighting.

164
00:11:50,679 --> 00:11:52,479
I meant, what have you
been busy with lately?

165
00:11:54,000 --> 00:11:55,000
Looking for medicine.

166
00:11:56,200 --> 00:11:57,200
Are you sick?

167
00:11:58,320 --> 00:11:59,320
Guo.

168
00:11:59,399 --> 00:12:00,879
How long until the livestream starts?

169
00:12:01,320 --> 00:12:02,399
Fifteen minutes.

170
00:12:03,919 --> 00:12:04,840
Take over for me for a bit.

171
00:12:04,879 --> 00:12:06,039
I need to use the restroom.

172
00:12:10,519 --> 00:12:11,720
Hi, Haohao.

173
00:12:24,679 --> 00:12:26,399
Your makeup is a bit heavy today, isn't it?

174
00:12:27,000 --> 00:12:28,319
Still can't lie to the fans.

175
00:12:28,320 --> 00:12:30,638
Go upstairs and rest for
a bit. You must be tired.

176
00:12:30,639 --> 00:12:31,878
I told you not to mess around.

177
00:12:31,879 --> 00:12:33,278
I'm not tired. I didn't even move.

178
00:12:33,279 --> 00:12:35,320
Look how natural you were ten years ago.

179
00:12:35,639 --> 00:12:37,000
I can't stream with you here.

180
00:12:38,639 --> 00:12:40,719
Who was it that said they
wanted to watch me stream?

181
00:12:41,480 --> 00:12:42,480
I miscalculated.

182
00:12:44,840 --> 00:12:47,000
Are you afraid I'll see you
two laughing and joking,

183
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:49,080
or afraid he'll see us
making eyes at each other?

184
00:12:50,799 --> 00:12:51,799
You're jealous.

185
00:12:57,639 --> 00:13:00,039
Brother Guo, are they still together?

186
00:13:00,200 --> 00:13:03,200
Trying to trick me? I'm not saying a word.

187
00:13:04,799 --> 00:13:05,799
I'm hard.

188
00:13:06,799 --> 00:13:07,639
Are you an animal?

189
00:13:07,799 --> 00:13:08,879
Aren't you one too?

190
00:13:09,039 --> 00:13:10,039
Stop messing around.

191
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,919
I'm here to boost your traffic.

192
00:13:14,679 --> 00:13:15,679
Okay.

193
00:13:28,799 --> 00:13:30,600
I remember when we
filmed together that year,

194
00:13:31,080 --> 00:13:34,799
a fan commented that Qinglang seemed
more immersed in the role than I was.

195
00:13:40,799 --> 00:13:42,200
We're still live.

196
00:13:42,879 --> 00:13:43,879
It's fine.

197
00:13:45,399 --> 00:13:46,439
But in the end, the one who fell too deep,

198
00:13:46,440 --> 00:13:47,920
the one who couldn't move on, was me.

199
00:13:53,519 --> 00:13:54,799
How am I supposed to stream now?

200
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:56,799
I don't know.

201
00:13:57,120 --> 00:13:58,720
Hurry up, I need to use the bathroom.

202
00:13:59,720 --> 00:14:01,039
You two, hurry up.

203
00:14:03,679 --> 00:14:05,240
Brother Guo, I didn't screen record.

204
00:14:06,039 --> 00:14:07,879
Last time you spoke up for Sister Jialin,

205
00:14:08,240 --> 00:14:09,600
that showed you have a conscience.

206
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:12,119
It's a good thing it wasn't lost before.

207
00:14:13,480 --> 00:14:15,639
You made your bed, now lie in it.

208
00:14:15,919 --> 00:14:17,080
Who else can you blame?

209
00:14:20,639 --> 00:14:22,279
Yeah, I don't blame anyone.

210
00:14:27,639 --> 00:14:29,720
I only blame myself for
being so blind back then.

211
00:14:30,039 --> 00:14:30,799
Stop.

212
00:14:31,039 --> 00:14:32,240
Don't be so sentimental.

213
00:14:32,679 --> 00:14:35,320
There's no point saying
this to him anymore.

214
00:14:35,720 --> 00:14:37,799
A missed chance is a missed chance.

215
00:14:43,320 --> 00:14:44,320
Aren't you hot?

216
00:15:04,519 --> 00:15:06,240
Here, Uncle, Auntie, hold this.

217
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:08,879
Yeah, that's right.

218
00:15:09,240 --> 00:15:11,056
(My son died because of this boy.)
Wait, when the livestream starts,

219
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,518
neither of you say a word the whole time.

220
00:15:12,519 --> 00:15:15,240
Just hold this whiteboard
and stare at the screen, okay?

221
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:16,919
Ah, right.
Like this?

222
00:15:17,841 --> 00:15:19,840
Yes, look here. Right, Auntie.

223
00:15:19,879 --> 00:15:21,039
Look a little sadder.

224
00:15:21,200 --> 00:15:22,678
Squeeze out some tears, okay?

225
00:15:22,679 --> 00:15:24,279
Here, Uncle, just stare at this.

226
00:15:24,399 --> 00:15:25,000
Is this good?
Get ready.

227
00:15:25,799 --> 00:15:26,799
Okay.

228
00:15:39,440 --> 00:15:42,480
Hello everyone, it's been a
long time since my last livestream.

229
00:15:43,279 --> 00:15:44,600
A year and three months.

230
00:15:45,039 --> 00:15:46,519
You guys kept track for me.

231
00:15:47,279 --> 00:15:48,359
What have I been busy with?

232
00:15:49,279 --> 00:15:51,279
Uh, preparing for a new show.

233
00:15:51,960 --> 00:15:53,680
How many hickeys did you actually give him?

234
00:15:54,399 --> 00:15:56,239
You can see for yourself
after the livestream.

235
00:15:56,919 --> 00:15:57,960
Is he here?

236
00:15:59,639 --> 00:16:02,159
He's requesting to join, let me accept it.

237
00:16:04,679 --> 00:16:05,679
Hello, old partner.

238
00:16:06,919 --> 00:16:09,662
You always talk about looking for medicine.
What kind of medicine are you looking for?

239
00:16:10,799 --> 00:16:12,759
I can't mention sensitive
words. I got a warning.

240
00:16:16,492 --> 00:16:19,799
[Plenty of homophobic comments in the chat]

241
00:16:48,519 --> 00:16:49,519
Brother Guo.

242
00:16:50,039 --> 00:16:51,039
Let's make a bet.

243
00:16:53,240 --> 00:16:54,960
I won't guess the exact number.

244
00:16:55,120 --> 00:16:56,360
You two are unpredictable.

245
00:16:57,879 --> 00:17:01,120
I guess more than three.

246
00:17:02,039 --> 00:17:03,679
If I guess right, 199.

247
00:17:05,079 --> 00:17:06,960
199 each, wanna bet?

248
00:17:07,519 --> 00:17:09,440
You two are using me as a bet?

249
00:17:15,240 --> 00:17:17,759
It's definitely not six. Six
is related to that person.

250
00:17:18,759 --> 00:17:20,440
Seven. I guess seven.

251
00:17:22,279 --> 00:17:23,279
Do you want to guess?

252
00:17:23,720 --> 00:17:24,920
You don't know either?

253
00:17:28,480 --> 00:17:29,480
Boring.

254
00:17:32,265 --> 00:17:33,265
I'll send the money.

255
00:17:33,480 --> 00:17:34,680
Really?

256
00:17:35,319 --> 00:17:36,359
Hahaha.

257
00:17:43,066 --> 00:17:44,319
[Money incoming alert]

258
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,160
The money arrived, you two have fun.

259
00:18:04,480 --> 00:18:05,720
You're really stirring the pot.

260
00:18:08,359 --> 00:18:09,936
You always talk about looking for medicine.

261
00:18:09,960 --> 00:18:10,960
What kind of medicine?

262
00:18:18,480 --> 00:18:20,559
What medicine can cure my lovesickness?

263
00:18:21,839 --> 00:18:24,759
Only Changyang entering my dreams.

264
00:18:38,039 --> 00:18:40,640
You're making the moves again tonight.

265
00:19:08,039 --> 00:19:09,519
Is this number safe?

266
00:19:09,920 --> 00:19:10,920
Yeah.

267
00:19:11,559 --> 00:19:12,559
Did you find anything?

268
00:19:13,240 --> 00:19:16,480
That guy is a nephew of Chen
Zhu's dad's cousin, named Chen Shuo.

269
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:18,880
He used to be a thug.

270
00:19:19,559 --> 00:19:21,440
In recent years, with
the rise of social media,

271
00:19:21,480 --> 00:19:22,680
he livestreams often.

272
00:19:23,160 --> 00:19:24,559
But it hasn't really taken off.

273
00:19:26,440 --> 00:19:28,960
He's a gambling addict,
trying every way to get money.

274
00:19:29,559 --> 00:19:30,559
Where does he live?

275
00:19:32,279 --> 00:19:34,839
Still looking into it. I'll let
you know when I find out.

276
00:19:35,240 --> 00:19:36,240
Okay.

277
00:19:36,759 --> 00:19:39,519
Are Xiaoxiao and Mom doing okay over there?

278
00:19:40,160 --> 00:19:41,160
Don't worry.

279
00:19:42,039 --> 00:19:43,039
I'm here.

280
00:19:43,920 --> 00:19:44,920
Thanks, bro.

281
00:19:45,440 --> 00:19:48,119
Don't mention it. Just
go with peace of mind.

282
00:20:04,680 --> 00:20:05,680
Where did you go?

283
00:20:06,279 --> 00:20:07,279
I was hungry.

284
00:20:11,359 --> 00:20:12,359
You didn't even move.

285
00:20:19,720 --> 00:20:22,559
There's a suburban market
tomorrow morning. I'll go early.

286
00:20:23,960 --> 00:20:24,960
Yeah.

287
00:20:33,880 --> 00:20:34,880
Fasten your seatbelt.

288
00:20:35,039 --> 00:20:36,079
Here we go.

289
00:20:36,440 --> 00:20:39,440
My favorite place is Molie. What about you?

290
00:20:39,759 --> 00:20:40,920
I like Xi Gui.

291
00:21:16,160 --> 00:21:17,239
Brother Pao.

292
00:21:17,240 --> 00:21:18,616
I'll definitely pay you back next month.

293
00:21:18,640 --> 00:21:19,838
Brother Pao, really.

294
00:21:19,839 --> 00:21:21,239
Brother Pao, I'll definitely pay
the money back next month.

295
00:21:21,240 --> 00:21:23,119
Brother Pao.

296
00:21:24,169 --> 00:21:24,982
Pay back the money.

297
00:21:25,293 --> 00:21:28,279
I'll pay.

298
00:21:36,039 --> 00:21:37,696
Brother Pao, I'll definitely
pay you back next month.

299
00:21:37,720 --> 00:21:38,919
Brother Pao, how about this?

300
00:21:38,920 --> 00:21:41,240
I'll definitely pay you back
next month, Brother Pao.

301
00:21:43,640 --> 00:21:46,119
No wonder he kept making us livestream.

302
00:21:49,279 --> 00:21:51,759
He won't give you the
money from the livestreams.

303
00:21:52,680 --> 00:21:53,680
Uncle, Auntie.

304
00:21:54,880 --> 00:21:56,279
Qingtian was my family.

305
00:21:56,880 --> 00:21:58,039
He's already gone.

306
00:22:03,440 --> 00:22:04,720
Just like your son.

307
00:22:05,759 --> 00:22:06,839
He's already gone.

308
00:22:12,160 --> 00:22:13,160
Let him go.

309
00:22:14,200 --> 00:22:15,920
Let the dead rest in peace.

310
00:22:16,759 --> 00:22:18,799
If you keep using him for livestreams,

311
00:22:19,160 --> 00:22:20,559
I won't let you off the hook.

312
00:22:21,319 --> 00:22:23,359
And Chen Shuo's creditors
won't let you off either.

313
00:24:02,359 --> 00:24:04,159
[From Changyang:] We recovered some data
from Qingtian's phone.

314
00:24:04,240 --> 00:24:05,640
We got a set of photos back.

315
00:24:06,240 --> 00:24:08,240
But the last video couldn't be restored.

316
00:24:08,720 --> 00:24:11,359
But I'm guessing it was a
recording of the Ghost Flower.

317
00:25:06,720 --> 00:25:07,720
Welcome back.

318
00:25:07,839 --> 00:25:08,839
Sir.

319
00:25:09,160 --> 00:25:10,599
Where do you want to go next?

320
00:25:11,599 --> 00:25:12,599
Home.

321
00:25:19,559 --> 00:25:22,640
We're home. No detours
when you ride with me. See ya.

322
00:25:59,599 --> 00:26:00,720
Wanna go to the market?

323
00:26:06,559 --> 00:26:07,559
What time is it?

324
00:26:08,160 --> 00:26:09,160
It's dawn.

325
00:26:13,119 --> 00:26:14,879
How am I supposed to
know what time dawn is?

326
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,160
Six o'clock.

327
00:26:33,359 --> 00:26:34,359
Let's go.

328
00:26:45,359 --> 00:26:46,359
He left.

329
00:26:46,960 --> 00:26:48,839
No, he's doing paperwork today.

330
00:26:49,799 --> 00:26:52,919
Two things. Snow Drum Verse is waiting
for your schedule to start shooting.

331
00:26:52,920 --> 00:26:53,960
Give me a definite answer.

332
00:26:54,720 --> 00:26:56,200
Give me two more days to reply.

333
00:26:56,599 --> 00:26:57,599
Still waiting?

334
00:26:58,559 --> 00:27:00,976
He returns to his unit on the 12th,
then we'll know when he leaves.

335
00:27:01,000 --> 00:27:02,599
I want to see him off before he goes.

336
00:27:02,720 --> 00:27:04,200
I advise you not to go.

337
00:27:05,000 --> 00:27:08,119
No matter how careful you
are, you won't be able to hide.

338
00:27:09,039 --> 00:27:10,519
The variety show is airing right now.

339
00:27:11,359 --> 00:27:13,640
Eight hundred paparazzi
eyes are staring right at you.

340
00:27:14,000 --> 00:27:15,119
The second thing.

341
00:27:15,839 --> 00:27:18,519
Someone was piggybacking off
your traffic the day you livestreamed.

342
00:27:20,359 --> 00:27:21,720
I looked into it.

343
00:27:22,160 --> 00:27:24,200
It was Qingtian's boyfriend's parents.

344
00:27:25,039 --> 00:27:27,960
That night, the account's
homepage and videos

345
00:27:28,160 --> 00:27:29,518
were all from that brand dinner

346
00:27:29,519 --> 00:27:31,119
you attended before.

347
00:27:32,759 --> 00:27:34,598
They were probably
recorded by guests at the event

348
00:27:34,599 --> 00:27:35,920
and reposted by this account.

349
00:27:38,119 --> 00:27:39,000
The day you livestreamed,

350
00:27:39,001 --> 00:27:40,399
this account also went live.

351
00:27:40,400 --> 00:27:42,920
And they got a lot of
traffic. What about now?

352
00:27:44,160 --> 00:27:46,200
I was going to keep an eye on it,

353
00:27:47,000 --> 00:27:49,359
but the account was
deleted the very next day.

354
00:27:50,160 --> 00:27:52,119
And I haven't seen his
parents livestream again.

355
00:27:52,519 --> 00:27:54,839
They were probably banned by the platform.

356
00:27:58,160 --> 00:28:00,799
The content on that
whiteboard was pretty sensitive.

357
00:28:04,839 --> 00:28:05,839
Sister Jialin.

358
00:28:06,559 --> 00:28:08,879
Changyang contacted you first
when he came back this time.

359
00:28:09,039 --> 00:28:10,039
What?

360
00:28:11,240 --> 00:28:12,639
That night you told me.

361
00:28:12,640 --> 00:28:14,519
Brother Guo brought Zhiyuan to the company.

362
00:28:14,920 --> 00:28:16,280
But it turned out to be Changyang.

363
00:28:17,200 --> 00:28:18,720
What else are you hiding from me?

364
00:28:20,559 --> 00:28:21,599
That's it.

365
00:28:22,640 --> 00:28:24,440
So I'm advising you not to see him off.

366
00:28:25,119 --> 00:28:27,359
No one will fight for
opportunities for him anymore.

367
00:28:28,720 --> 00:28:30,160
Don't say I told you.

368
00:28:30,200 --> 00:28:31,480
He wouldn't let me say anything.

369
00:28:34,039 --> 00:28:35,039
Hanging up.

370
00:28:55,720 --> 00:28:56,880
Are there any cars, Jiang Yi?

371
00:29:11,440 --> 00:29:13,240
Where do you want to go, my god?

372
00:29:15,000 --> 00:29:16,599
Navigate to the city detention center.

373
00:29:17,359 --> 00:29:19,640
Alright, fasten your seatbelt.

374
00:29:19,920 --> 00:29:21,240
Even gods need to be protected.

375
00:29:27,000 --> 00:29:28,359
Are you done with the paperwork?

376
00:29:29,960 --> 00:29:31,160
You can't be without me now.

377
00:29:32,920 --> 00:29:33,920
I can't.

378
00:29:35,720 --> 00:29:36,759
We're heading back.

379
00:29:38,359 --> 00:29:39,359
Slow down.

380
00:29:46,960 --> 00:29:48,335
I didn't tell my family I was back.

381
00:29:48,359 --> 00:29:49,759
I'm using a different phone number.

382
00:29:51,920 --> 00:29:53,920
I have some paperwork to do before I leave.

383
00:29:53,960 --> 00:29:55,560
You can schedule your work for that day.

384
00:31:03,512 --> 00:31:05,008
There's a market tomorrow morning.

385
00:31:05,039 --> 00:31:06,240
I'll go early.

386
00:31:07,640 --> 00:31:08,119
Yeah.

387
00:31:08,120 --> 00:31:09,240
Going to the market?

388
00:31:51,720 --> 00:31:53,440
Auntie, please pack all of these up for me.

389
00:31:54,160 --> 00:31:56,119
My mom and grandma both like you.

390
00:31:57,359 --> 00:31:58,559
Elderly mom fans.

391
00:31:58,640 --> 00:31:59,720
Elderly mother-in-law fans.

392
00:32:01,640 --> 00:32:02,359
How much are these?
Uh, the big ones are six bucks.

393
00:32:03,160 --> 00:32:04,160
The small ones are five.

394
00:32:04,200 --> 00:32:05,358
This one is six.

395
00:32:05,359 --> 00:32:06,319
I'll take the six-buck ones.
Do you want this one?

396
00:32:07,119 --> 00:32:07,920
Ah, six bucks.

397
00:32:07,960 --> 00:32:09,040
Auntie, I'll take this one.

398
00:32:11,920 --> 00:32:12,920
Six, right?

399
00:32:13,200 --> 00:32:14,319
May wealth come your way.

400
00:32:19,039 --> 00:32:20,039
Here.

401
00:32:23,960 --> 00:32:25,640
This is like feeding chickens.

402
00:32:36,559 --> 00:32:37,440
Here you go, boss.
You got it!

403
00:32:43,039 --> 00:32:44,039
This one.

404
00:32:47,519 --> 00:32:48,559
Mmm, is it good?

405
00:32:48,960 --> 00:32:49,960
It's delicious.

406
00:32:50,240 --> 00:32:51,359
I want some too.

407
00:33:01,400 --> 00:33:03,280
Tianyi's mushrooms can
be shipped to Shangjing.

408
00:33:03,559 --> 00:33:05,039
This market is pretty legit.

409
00:33:05,240 --> 00:33:07,360
What's even more legit is
that no one recognizes you.

410
00:33:08,079 --> 00:33:09,319
I don't attract elderly fans.

411
00:33:09,359 --> 00:33:10,039
Then I'll take them.

412
00:33:10,040 --> 00:33:11,920
Knock yourself out, you young old man.

413
00:33:34,720 --> 00:33:35,838
Look how happy Tian is.

414
00:33:35,839 --> 00:33:36,839
I know, right?

415
00:33:36,960 --> 00:33:39,920
This is such a great shot.

416
00:33:40,160 --> 00:33:41,999
I'm telling you, our Tian

417
00:33:42,000 --> 00:33:43,599
could be a big star too.

418
00:34:06,759 --> 00:34:07,839
Once you start school,

419
00:34:08,320 --> 00:34:10,559
you won't be able to contact home, right?

420
00:34:11,239 --> 00:34:12,239
Yeah.

421
00:34:12,719 --> 00:34:16,360
Before I leave, I'll schedule
messages to send out.

422
00:34:17,159 --> 00:34:18,159
For how long?

423
00:34:21,760 --> 00:34:22,920
Enough for a hundred years.

424
00:34:24,039 --> 00:34:25,920
Are you writing a novel?

425
00:34:26,559 --> 00:34:27,760
You're so full of it.

426
00:34:32,559 --> 00:34:34,519
Is there really no exact timeframe?

427
00:34:38,920 --> 00:34:39,920
Changyang,

428
00:34:40,400 --> 00:34:42,519
Are you hiding some kind of plan from me?

429
00:34:43,639 --> 00:34:45,320
I could never hide anything from you.

430
00:34:45,559 --> 00:34:46,599
You already know my heart.

431
00:34:53,119 --> 00:34:55,959
If one day I announce to the world
that I'm retiring from the industry,

432
00:34:56,360 --> 00:34:57,960
you'd better come running back.

433
00:35:06,159 --> 00:35:07,440
Is that a secret code?
